File: src/fit_mesg_definition.cpp
Function: MesgDefinition::GetFieldByIndex
One decode of the test corpus takes about 358.135 ms.

Rewrite this function to make decoding faster:
```cpp
FieldDefinition* MesgDefinition::GetFieldByIndex(const FIT_UINT16 index)
{
    if (index < fields.size())
        return &(fields[index]);

    return FIT_NULL;
}
```
